{"3456920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isle Of Pirates", "steam_appid": 3456920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Ahoy, Captain! Welcome to Isle of Pirates! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The waves are calling you, the wind fills your sails! From a deserted island to an epic pirate paradise, will you have the courage and wit to lead the way? If your answer is <strong>&quot;Aye, Captain!&quot;</strong>, then you’re in the right waters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Resources!</strong><br>A sailor’s treasure isn’t just gold! Chop down trees, break stones, and collect materials! Remember, a strong pirate base needs a solid foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/50c1d2887045bbb1564c3af54d9b0bb1.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/50c1d2887045bbb1564c3af54d9b0bb1.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/50c1d2887045bbb1564c3af54d9b0bb1.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Tavern!</strong><br>Every great captain needs a home! Use your resources to build an epic pirate tavern and spread your name across the oceans with every wave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/4139693a70cb0b3c65a62c75cf9504f4.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/4139693a70cb0b3c65a62c75cf9504f4.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/4139693a70cb0b3c65a62c75cf9504f4.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate Your Tavern!</strong><br>Pirates don’t just swing swords; they love a good atmosphere too! Hang lanterns from the ceiling, pin ancient maps to the walls, or maybe make space for a pirate band? Should it be lavish, or more like a dark pirate lair? The choice is yours, Captain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set Sail into the Blue Waters!</strong><br>There are unexplored islands on the horizon, lands that aren’t even on the map! The helm is calling you, are you ready to explore? Remember, great treasures require great adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/307901079e50241ba01d72399e98eb30.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/307901079e50241ba01d72399e98eb30.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/307901079e50241ba01d72399e98eb30.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Find Treasure!</strong><br>Old maps, forgotten ruins, and pirate legends… Find the lost treasure chests, grab the gold, and carve your name into pirate history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/d771cae5aba9e19a756559913972c2a7.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/d771cae5aba9e19a756559913972c2a7.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/d771cae5aba9e19a756559913972c2a7.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Crew!</strong><br>You can't sail the open seas alone, Captain! Find loyal crew members to join your journey, lead them, and etch your name into the annals of pirate lore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/f6d41581a09f65eb82eaf886db1c1e94.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/f6d41581a09f65eb82eaf886db1c1e94.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/f6d41581a09f65eb82eaf886db1c1e94.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend Your Island!</strong><br>Don’t forget, the seas are filled with more enemies than allies! Defend your island from tricksters, sneaky treasure hunters, and other greedy pirates! Strengthen your walls and prepare your cannons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/8c0e4d3f2277d333eb220d574919a93e.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/8c0e4d3f2277d333eb220d574919a93e.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/8c0e4d3f2277d333eb220d574919a93e.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will Legends Speak of You?</strong><br>Will you be the one the winds whisper about, or will you write your own tale? Isle of Pirates is waiting for you, Captain! <strong>Hoist the sails, the adventure begins!</strong> 🏴‍☠️<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/b101e311f459d197a8118c3d04288b6f.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/b101e311f459d197a8118c3d04288b6f.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/b101e311f459d197a8118c3d04288b6f.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Ahoy, Captain! Welcome to Isle of Pirates! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The waves are calling you, the wind fills your sails! From a deserted island to an epic pirate paradise, will you have the courage and wit to lead the way? If your answer is <strong>&quot;Aye, Captain!&quot;</strong>, then you’re in the right waters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather Resources!</strong><br>A sailor’s treasure isn’t just gold! Chop down trees, break stones, and collect materials! Remember, a strong pirate base needs a solid foundation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb