izon, lands that aren’t even on the map! The helm is calling you, are you ready to explore? Remember, great treasures require great adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/307901079e50241ba01d72399e98eb30.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/307901079e50241ba01d72399e98eb30.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/307901079e50241ba01d72399e98eb30.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Find Treasure!</strong><br>Old maps, forgotten ruins, and pirate legends… Find the lost treasure chests, grab the gold, and carve your name into pirate history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/d771cae5aba9e19a756559913972c2a7.poster.avif?t=1779504225\" width=426 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/d771cae5aba9e19a756559913972c2a7.webm?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3456920/extras/d771cae5aba9e19a756559913972c2a7.mp4?t=1779504225\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Your Crew!</strong><br>You can't sail the open seas alone, Captain! Find loyal crew members to join your journey, lead them, and etch your name into the annals of pirate lore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><